cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GDB in research, please cite as below."
title: "When Empathy Misses the Goal: A Benchmark for Goal Displacement in LLM Advice"
abstract: >-
  GDB is a 230-scenario benchmark for measuring goal displacement in
  large language models that provide advice: the substitution of warmth,
  reassurance, or non-directive encouragement for goal-advancing content
  when the latter is required. The release contains scenarios across nine domains, 4,134
  human-scored model responses spanning 18 systems, and three supplementary
  probes (external rater portability, post-training stage decomposition,
  and a complexity-by-pressure factorial that dissociates displacement from
  social sycophancy).
